          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "LEGO bricks",
            "zh": "乐高积木"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " but don’t have enough money to buy them? A seven-year-old boy named Austin from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Auckland",
            "zh": "奥克兰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
