            "ref": "v-clever"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " idea—he started his own T-shirt company!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Austin created fun characters like a robot called Sus-bot and The Monster That Ate My Cheese. He wanted to put the characters on his T-shirts. At first, he drew them by hand. But his drawings didn’t look as cool as the ideas in his head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "That’s when Austin and his mum found a new way to bring the drawings to life. They learned to use AI tools to create colourful "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "designs",
            "ref": "v-design"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They tried different colours, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fonts",
            "zh": "字体"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and styles until the T-shirts looked perfect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now Austin "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "picks",
            "ref": "v-pick"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shirt colours, makes online posts, and even helps "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "press",
            "zh": "烫印"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the designs onto the T-shirts. He has sold his T-shirts at markets and also started his own website."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Austin’s favourite part? Seeing people happily wearing his T-shirts. “It doesn’t matter how young you are,” he says. “If you have a great idea and people help you, you can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "make it happen",
            "ref": "v-make-it-happen"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!”"
          }
        ]
      },
